&lt;h2 id="あらすじ"&gt;あらすじ&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Once per several hundred years the Gods summon a human to their domain for eight days to study human nature. Main character is such a summoned man. Different Gods represent different elements and main character is given cards representing different elements to use wisely in conversations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[From &lt;a href="https://vndbreview.blogspot.ru/2017/10/vn-of-month-may-1999.html"&gt;vndbreview&lt;/a&gt;]&lt;/p&gt;
